{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "f87ba2e0517253c0f89ab8a078bbbd3e76f3870a818819be6bca9a384b04002b", "ja": "リーダー・ナイトフィーバー", "zh": "队长狂热之夜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "adde0df9d90c764c3ed7cc7f6e3526ec211f35520db9485d35efb6de2333a0ae", "ja": "夜になり、歩とのり子の希望でディスコへと\nやってきた。雰囲気を楽しみつつ、歩はダン\nスを披露してフロアを盛り上げる。そんな歩\nの姿を見たのり子は、なにか思うところがあ\nる様子で…？", "zh": "到了夜晚，大家应步和法子的希望来到了\n迪斯科舞厅。一边享受着现场的气氛，步一\n边大秀舞技炒热了舞池。而看到步这样的姿\n态，法子似乎有所触动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd9dc60275115968afc07a06242d052aa137e231578afebec65be08aa1679df2", "ja": "（太陽が沈み、夜の帳が下りた。\n90年代を一番感じられる場所といえば……）", "zh": "（太阳西沉，夜幕降临。\n要说最能感受到90年代气息的地方……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "46021de1771167799c0466d604693becaa3eb8485644dbfdaed62285929deb38", "ja": "やっぱり、ディスコだよね！\nしかも、本物！", "zh": "果然还是迪斯科吧！\n而且还是货真价实的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "a4c8a54be4c1932b1055d57beb69464e810ba802c783f32565ab9eb2b5e5ff18", "ja": "うわ～、重低音が体に響くね！\nミラーボールも大きくて、迫力あるなぁ。", "zh": "哇～，低沉的重音在身体里回响呢！\n连舞厅的镜球都好大，真有冲击力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cdde2202e8d2ce36ef3bd5be56ecee51c54d5243a62df1fbb03ccd05f5be8264", "ja": "まさか、ふたりの行ってみたい場所が\nディスコだったとはな……。", "zh": "真没想到，你们两个人想去的地方\n居然会是迪厅啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4cfbaa9469bdaef9c866a56e2ffa77935469b6ea2b5cabfa2d702e37045acb49", "ja": "やっぱ、90年代と言ったらね♪　連れてきてくれて\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "果然，说到90年代嘛♪谢谢你带我来，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "8e09e29a3d727c766b15a1c3b1151cd853fe714f1d55a2c594566823cbab7681", "ja": "海美とエレナも連れてきたかったけど、さすがに\nちょっと早いかもだから。ここは大人組だけでね♪", "zh": "本来也想把海美和艾蕾娜一起带来的，不过现在可能还是有点早了。所以这次就只有大人组啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1006_se", "source_sha256": "fdb236ec2f4f7f5a512553c79d540dbd7a0b71283896090e638250cb66fa1c96", "ja": "ドンッ", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "75b3b3234ddba59d2cc87bd736f4aac16d24f52efcd20f63bd1cb4944ac3dd1c", "ja": "あっ、ぶつかっちゃった。\nごめんなさい！", "zh": "啊，不小心撞到了。\n对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "8c9ca2cbd7ac4ba0d7a12c0b9d6f199a8c10930dc0a22d2fb50a1f606284dc2d", "ja": "へっ！？\nお、怒ってるのかな……？", "zh": "诶！？\n难、难道是在生气吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "49f20290a49df0998c4c94d1f77b8aa8b4afa22ccdf77da3e61cb9b4cd2339a8", "ja": "そういうわけじゃなさそうだ。多分だけど、\n「盛り上がってるか？」とかそういう感じの……。", "zh": "看起来不是那样。大概吧，\n感觉是在说“气氛热烈吗？”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3aec3fcb59530262b0bd31d60525ecdecdeb52c4c9a35960f666238be3118731", "ja": "あー、Yeah！　オーケーオーケー！\nアイムファイン！", "zh": "啊——Yeah！OK、OK！\n我很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d7cf9437aa0a378a0726a6199d861a4fb09d909bf8e4464b5192946e62fb187e", "ja": "行っちゃったな。\n特に問題なかったみたいだ。", "zh": "已经走了啊。看起来没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "a8b426854e3d3901877b9118dcf38034d56ea807ecb42675b09d8afaac61a6e6", "ja": "おお……さすが歩！　ありがとう！\nさらっと答えられるなんて、かっこいいじゃん♪", "zh": "哦哦……不愧是步！谢谢你！\n能这么轻松地回答出来，真帅气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c2162fced31f69bad5b66d8b153e6996aa03f41a9d9c75587add04ae1f43e665", "ja": "いやぁ、ディスコでテンションあがってるからかな？\n舌の滑りもいいっていうか……。", "zh": "哎呀，可能是因为在迪斯科舞厅里情绪很高涨吧？\n感觉说话也特别顺溜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3f0c991535d14156687075df61746c07e8b8cd5723106e3a15ad06cf8c4b329c", "ja": "あ、この曲知ってる！　{$P$}、\nちょっと踊ってきてもいいっ？", "zh": "啊，我知道这首歌！{$P$}，\n我可以去跳一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "589898b6ce6a71dadc99381cac16b58113c844c73a27c09f66fa19f2a4da46d0", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。ここからでも見えるような、\n目立つところで踊ってくるといい！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以。去显眼一点的地方跳吧，这样我在这里也能看见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "05d8870b421bc9ee20744929e807ef01b585def9e39841686ee45ab51bbad38d", "ja": "OK！　アタシから目を離さないでよ！", "zh": "OK！可别把视线从我身上移开哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d1e3acc794f50ea0743d13fad005074e95850c476d7282c48759aed8e4cd6a62", "ja": "よっ！　こんなのどう！？", "zh": "看招！这招怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1020_nekkyousurufuroa", "source_sha256": "1e59bf4307a0a545bedb644043f1f7e99ea68c1b2103f3604145d8afd5168a57", "ja": "ワアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "96f396a0f6fa0f245a9ac01f4d509c989a91be5afbc17c58d204e1c0e6b583c2", "ja": "（歩、流石だな……！　いつの間にか、\nフロアの注目を独り占めしてしまっている）", "zh": "（不愧是步……！不知不觉间，\n已经吸引了全场的目光）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "72641f068f9ae1a743dd427f5176d382cf2940f87bff8ccfd497e24383d68be1", "ja": "さあ、みんなも踊って踊って！\nひとりだと退屈だからね！", "zh": "来吧，大家也一起跳起来！\n一个人跳很无聊嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15a22597ca5e4213f0e27f4bfa37f8ba8bce0e7dac56261bd700de66d43b9719", "ja": "そうそう！　こんなに気持ちよく踊るの、\n久しぶりだよ！　イェーイ！", "zh": "对对！像这样跳得这么畅快，真是好久没有过了！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2d248b4a46a6013fe219634d685ec9ff03bbe2e637724c340a43a0b2cd19f155", "ja": "あれ？　どうしたんだ、のり子？\n人が多くて、疲れたか？", "zh": "咦？怎么了，法子？\n人这么多，累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "8149fd1bfccae58608f249bff7d9008e814532b54ac1dc286089f3e058be52ff", "ja": "あ、ううん。……ねえ、{$P$}。\n歩、なんかすごく楽しそうだよね？", "zh": "啊，不是。……那个，{$P$}。\n步，好像特别开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ffbef4993ef0ba19e82c0ae056436beb88165b620cd5cac73db4480fa0e0e992", "ja": "ああ。笑顔が弾けてて、ダンスもキレがいい！\n見ているだけで楽しくなってくるよ。", "zh": "对。她笑容灿烂，舞蹈也干脆利落！\n光是看着她，就让人开心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "711165eff330d04b0f90a323381034e76b7fe8bff70cd8130761e171aff6d4d5", "ja": "もしかして、歩ってさ……。\nアタシたちに……。", "zh": "该不会，步她……\n是在配合我们……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e822ca0fd7d351bd505f4d67053590663b7e1efd605ed36e3fac79dc728e840f", "ja": "のり子？", "zh": "法子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "ce3fa51f487846265a43423de5cf7d9eaaf3240145a7fca45c7cac7bf6a7d377", "ja": "んっと……や、やっぱ、なんでもないや！\nえへへ……。", "zh": "嗯……没、没什么，还是算了！\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "957f9b819ccf046637d1e3c949c1be3be3758636b99aed931a9f00baddcb043a", "ja": "（のり子、何か気にしているみたいだな……。ここじゃ\n賑やかだから、劇場に帰ったら話を聞いてみるか）", "zh": "（看来法子好像有什么在意的事……这里太吵了，\n等回剧场后再听她说说吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
